  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat, around 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the smoked paprika, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the chicken wings to the bowl and toss to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "Brush the grill grates with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
